# Line endings.
#
# The repo is authored on Windows but every file in the index is LF. Without
# this file, any tool that round-trips a file through a Windows text write
# rewrites it CRLF, and git then reports the ENTIRE file as changed — a one-line
# edit shows up as 677 insertions / 661 deletions. During the 2026-08 audit
# remediation that buried real changes across 16+ files and made review
# impossible; 2,592 worktree files were CRLF at the time.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalises on commit and checks out LF, so the working tree
# and the index agree and diffs stay honest.
#
# After changing this file, run once:  git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.zip   binary

# Generated — keep out of review noise and out of merge resolution.
pnpm-lock.yaml       -diff linguist-generated
apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma  text eol=lf
graft/**             -diff linguist-generated
